{"v":4,"catch":"智取父母，逃離他們的監視！","desc":"在 SchoolBoy Simulator 遊戲中，您因為成績不好而被困在家裡，您的父母正為難您。他們把您鎖在家中，現在就看您如何偷偷摸摸、智取他們，然後逃到朋友家玩。\n\n悄悄地移動、解謎，並找出巧妙的方法避免被您霸道的父母抓到。每個聲音都很重要，小心不要出錯！\n\n有了隱身、策略和一點點運氣，您能掙脫束縛，重獲自由嗎？在這場緊張刺激、鬼鬼祟祟的冒險中，最重要的是保持聰明和沉默！","publisher":"TrueMotion Interactive","release":"2025-04-17","genres":["模擬"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["西班牙文","英文","法文","德文","葡萄牙文","俄文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.8GB / Switch 0.8GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e13ab0203d56af167a34bddb7d9fcd812102576de03503e18b06f838925243ad.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/04cf70409eee796a730602d15bfb8df51b2a601242865a9419e11128762b2ba7.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/bd0b6628e1a5055e64aea0aa0f25fef8958b6cdf7b780f2933e15f5d888f2e34.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/2fb34228d96be06214edfec6f88ef7f58f39e869a566a73862286216199f2cd1.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e4ca584af10e46517fc6f6a0a6d85f4153342851e99ebf1791f4ed61ae21ac58.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f8759f73429e7f382b47dd9bf7b63b620412a1e0367400226ca68a6f83aa2ed8.jpg"],"titleId":"01008ad022da8000","dlc":[]}